From 95ebeea968b92e7dc6b33c008b4aacf285aeda93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:45:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Add glass refraction for keys

Keys sample the keyboard's own background image through an AGSL lens shader
(Android 13+): almost flat inside, bending over the edge, with dispersion and a
slightly darker rim. Switch "Glass refraction", needs glass key style, and is
exclusive with the real-time blur since it refracts the keyboard background
rather than the content behind the window.
